OL,3,GNEWSATown voted most 'dog-friendly' for
OL,4,Asecond time                            
OL,6,FA Suffolk town has once again been     
OL,7,Fcrowned the most dog-friendly in the   
OL,8,Fcountry.                               
OL,10,FBury St Edmunds came out on top at this
OL,11,Fyear's DogFriendly Awards after the    
OL,12,Fpublic voted it the most accommodating.
OL,13,FIt also received the award in 2024 and 
OL,14,Fcame runner-up in 2025.                
OL,16,FMark Cordell, chief executive of Our   
OL,17,FBury St Edmunds Business Improvement   
OL,18,FDistrict (BID), said the accolade is   
OL,19,F"of huge importance to the visitor     
OL,20,Feconomy in Bury".                      
